<title>RUSSIA: Russia MOST-Bank 96 pre-tax up to 133.92 bln rbls.</title>
<headline>Russia MOST-Bank 96 pre-tax up to 133.92 bln rbls.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31,</p>
<p>(in billions of roubles)</p>
<p>				    1996		  1995</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   133.92		109.58</p>
<p>    Assets		  11,028.12	    3,637.34</p>
<p>    Shareholders' funds    604.63		413.92</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are according to Russian accounting standards. Full name KB MOST-Bank.</p>
<p>MOST-Bank authorised capital is 175 billion roubles.</p>
<p>--Alexei Pankratov, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
